      "sourceTextSha256": "ea688b5812057edcf2213009326f0a8cfc31906560e3bb085a98db899efb5cbe",
      "text": "Day 4 · Breakfast and tour of the Sacred Valley of the Incas, home to Pisac, Ollantaytambo, Chinchero and Urubamba. Browse the Pisac artisan market for ceramics, rugs, silver and leather; at Awanakancha, admire and feed llamas, alpacas, guanacos and vicuñas and learn about wool production and natural dyeing; then visit Ollantaytambo, one of the most important Inca complexes. Buffet lunch at the Muña restaurant and return to the hotel.",
